It is Thursday evening, half past five.
I am at the badminton club.
I rent a racket at the reception.
Timo, Lena and Max are already waiting on the court.
We are playing a doubles match today.
We also played last week.
Last week Max and Timo won.
But I trained extra yesterday!
Today Lena and I are playing fantastically.
The match is fast and really fun.
"Super, Maya, you scored the point!" calls Lena.
"You guys did that great," says Max and laughs.
After an hour, the match is over.
Lena and I really won today!
Max packs his things.
"I am saying goodbye now," he says to us.
"I have to get up early tomorrow."
He waves to us and leaves.
Timo, Lena and I stay in the hall a little longer.
We sit down together and talk.
